        "text": "Page: Peter Jackson (historian). Sentence: Peter Jackson is a scholar and historian, specializing in the Crusades, particularly the contacts between the Europeans and the Mongols as well as medieval Muslim India.\nPage: Peter Jackson (historian). Sentence: He is Emeritus Professor of Medieval History at Keele University and editor of \"The Cambridge History of Iran: The Timurid and Safavid Periods\".\nPage: Keele University. Sentence: Keele University, officially known as the University of Keele, is a public research university located about 3 miles (5 km) from Newcastle-under-Lyme, Staffordshire, England.\nPage: Keele University. Sentence: Keele was granted university status by Royal Charter in 1962 and was founded in 1949 as the University College of North Staffordshire.",
